 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't file the Transport management system (TMS) request for Tom Becker: Tom Becker is leaving or has left (status terminated). Offboarding (voluntary departures) (POL-OFF-01): When an employee resigns or a contract ends, their manager or HR starts offboarding with the last working day. Access to every system is removed at 17:00 local time on the last day. Laptops and badges must be returned within 5 business days after the last day; IT emails a prepaid return label. Questions about final pay or unused PTO go to HR. An employee cannot start their own offboarding; they tell their manager or HR.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-01"
 ]
}
